       "description": "<ul>\n<li>FINALLY fixed salvage zones :prayge:</li>\n<li>salvage zone UI update + icon!</li>\n<li>add random craft result amount options</li>\n<li>initialized buyrestrictioncurrent for traderhelper barters (ty for the detailed bug report!)</li>\n<li>added client handling for random craft amounts</li>\n<li>added better validation warnings and a config for validation logging</li>\n<li>added fixplugintypesserialization patcher (thank you tarkin ❤️)</li>\n<li>added new quest service for making quest items</li>\n<li>removed dependency on spt customitemservice</li>\n</ul>\n",
